  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-block-bridge-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7fec754581895175fea93cc6964e9264038f677f5951a2438c182dfa65210429",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4e9135ce20e2b53e5af05017c421c585983321c1272a4828b92a26e1b87234ce",
      "text": "悟空的积木小桥",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bb7add9c956ec38e57e5089cd342ec03f9e1c17b7f43ddbcaab94981d96fefa1",
      "text": "悟空、敖丙和八戒一起搭轨道。\n“呜呜——\n小火车开过来啦！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae56864d70e9ecec2a21e1c14f115974977ec66a00693a25285edaf8e114530b",
      "text": "哎呀！\n一条蓝色小河挡住了路。\n“小火车需要一座桥。”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "008b203f0dc979fe4a0044f1ea26571f848991a2526b8924fce5087702c61b08",
      "text": "敖丙问：“这条河有多宽？”\n悟空说：“我们来量一量！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d897c82c80e95b5c9f8b50d09ac7de38c913277e0d524c34fbb19f1b57db476a",
      "text": "悟空用他的积木量：\n“一、二、三。\n三块那么宽！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b78013799dfe1cb846ae5d4771a0fb14019dd55a12d806cb57f52d67c3911b06",
      "text": "敖丙用他的积木量：\n“一、二、三、四、五。\n五块那么宽！”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "33d688d8b7629ab195721dc9d7437505396aa2ccdd5c3ffd4a63cd7a715f8075",
      "text": "悟空说：“三块！”\n敖丙说：“五块！”\n八戒凑近一看：\n“你们的积木不一样大呀！”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d8ce3fd5547285ad363321d02d7d2468c3e45559608975c79455e1c2eca7596",
      "text": "八戒搬来一盒黄积木：\n“这些积木一样大。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ed8740aee98aaa7a494b66d4d83d9ce652bcc24409343bf0f3d5f5d7934ebf08",
      "text": "悟空放得飞快：\n啪、啪、啪！\n八戒说：“等一等！\n中间不能留空！”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a2f98ef113e14fa26ff5f5b56041fff968d443e3f0bcc42b66209d50630f7d4",
      "text": "他们把积木推到一起，\n一块挨着一块，\n中间不留空。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ace6f27fb97a2e50d38c2a2f08c7cca3866d9e5b95181e74e2fe494eb2ca494a",
      "text": "“一、二、三、四。”\n“这条河有四块积木那么宽！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6c63565eb1a460f203633f77973a05634c73d50023c05a103e923de24c8c0a2e",
      "text": "敖丙找来一块木板，\n它有三块积木那么长。\n“太短啦！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6fc866aac5fdbd674d345529e78cf9a5447ac89e3962a79fa6f1f7877903f937",
      "text": "他们还是试了试。\n扑通！\n木板掉进河里了。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90992d437e755ed10fb2287093483d745974cfcdeefbfc579505af0c11a17986",
      "text": "八戒找来一块更长的木板，\n它有五块积木那么长，\n两边都搭得到！\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bad433b8b72b0aca2290511f98b67bca3755ac084aadd65adc828369e7d4bfd1",
      "text": "“呜呜——”\n小火车开过了小桥，\n大家一起欢呼！\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a99f5b0cf3223e5949cf09a9d2a4cecf73dfcc0b3e480fe7a65909cf7b73cea1",
      "text": "八戒给车站做了个牌子，\n看起来像一块饼干。\n“下一站：点心站！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
